# Lecture Notes

Two proof-focused manuscripts are maintained:

- `Lecture draft/Lecture draft.tex`: the b-calculus, Fredholm theory on
  cylindrical ends, the b-trace defect, and the Atiyah--Patodi--Singer theorem.
- `Lecture draft/Atiyah-Singer index theorem.tex`: elliptic operators, heat
  kernels, Clifford modules, the local index theorem, Gauss--Bonnet, the
  signature theorem, and Riemann--Roch.

The July 2026 revision is a line-by-line mathematical edit of the original
lecture transcriptions. Relevant classroom discussion is retained as concise
Discussion and Question/Answer interludes; speaker attributions, unresolved
chatter, duplicated chapters, generated files, and unrelated archive material
are omitted. Definitions precede use, theorem hypotheses are explicit, and
proof gaps are filled or identified as standard input. Reproducible TikZ
diagrams replace the useful hand-drawn figures.

## Build

From `Lecture draft/`:

```sh
latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error "Lecture draft.tex"
latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error "Atiyah-Singer index theorem.tex"
```

Both manuscripts build with pdfLaTeX. Build products are intentionally
untracked.
